      {
        "id": "0c140000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Ask as early as you can. For holiday, give at least twice as much notice as the time you want off, such as two weeks' notice for a week's holiday, unless your contract says otherwise. If your manager has to refuse a holiday request, they will tell you at least as far ahead as the length of the holiday you asked for.",
